B.Zf=new A.nR("IM Charts","Open-source financial charting library for Flutter & Dart","Ever wanted to build a full trading terminal in Flutter? IM Charts is an open-source, highly customisable financial charting library with candlestick, Heikin-Ashi, line & area charts, interactive drawing tools, trendlines, supply/demand zones, Fibonacci retracement, RSI, MACD, EMA, Bollinger Bands, volume profile, VWAP, real-time tick \u2192 candle aggregation, zoom/pan, crosshair, and more \u2014 all rendered natively with CustomPainter. This is v0.1.0 \u2014 the community decides what comes next.","Open Source \xb7 Flutter Package",B.Um,"https://lykanimran.github.io/im_charts/","https://github.com/LykanImran/im_charts","https://pub.dev/packages/im_charts",B.QM)
