B.Zd=new A.nR("Deagle","The PM tool your team will actually enjoy using","Spreadsheets were fine\u2026 until projects got real. Deagle is a clean, fast, cross-platform project management tool built with Flutter & Firebase. It brings user roles & orgs, task assignment with priorities and timelines, status boards (To Do \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Done), decision logs, async daily updates, real-time sync with offline support \u2014 all in one lightweight interface that feels like a spreadsheet but works like magic.","SaaS \xb7 Cross-Platform \xb7 Web & Mobile",B.Vk,"https://deagle-5a607.web.app/",null,null,B.uB)
